{"4565520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Booty", "steam_appid": 4565520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4756620], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565520/extras/55fe4e697dd4d1b5576b00d408cf7175.avif?t=1784649706\" width=550 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wacky <strong>rocket-jumping</strong> mechanic! Lots of mobility from surfing explosions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the launcher to <strong>blast away landlubbers</strong> and blocks on your warpath!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn</strong> graphics! Unlockable art gallery with more of Maggie's troublemaking!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GREED</strong>! Grab all the treasures you can get! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry</strong>! Maggie has been cursed with <strong>GOLD BLOOD!</strong> Time it right and absorb projectiles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get bootiful <strong>Ranks</strong> by being both greedy and speedy! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get revenge on the one who stole your <strong>Booty!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rated <strong>P</strong> for <strong>Pirates</strong>!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565520/extras/b227864d68f51721e1e77c229681f710.avif?t=1784649706\" width=750 height=183 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Maggie has lost her titular, precious <strong>Booty</strong><i>(tm)</i> to a bloody marine <strong>sharkgirl</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With her navigation skills, Maggie will cruise the seas and islands, full of weirdos in search of clues!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But there are <strong>many</strong>, including <strong>marines</strong>, that want Maggie's bountiful reward, for the many <strong>&quot;oopsie-daisies&quot;</strong> that Maggie <strong>&quot;allegedly&quot; committed </strong>with evidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">So, it's not gonna be easy, but Maggie has a <strong>Ph.D in Rocket Jumping</strong> (she made it herself)!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sometimes she talks to her <strong>Rocket Launcher</strong>, it's a bit weird.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565520/extras/19692813c36ae728cd6ed3ed52eb9ee4.avif?t=1784649706\" width=300 height=306 /></span> <i><strong>...AND NOW... THE MAGGIE...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565520/extras/55fe4e697dd4d1b5576b00d408cf7175.avif?t=1784649706\" width=550 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wacky <strong>rocket-jumping</strong> mechanic! Lots of mobility from surfing explosions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the launcher to <strong>blast away landlubbers</strong> and blocks on your warpath!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn</strong> graphics! Unlockable art gallery with more of Maggie's troublemaking!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GREED</strong>! Grab all the treasures you can get! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry</strong>! Maggie has been cursed with <strong>GOLD BLOOD!</strong> Time it right and absorb projectiles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get bootiful <strong>Ranks</strong> by being both greedy and speedy! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get revenge on the one who stole your <strong>Booty!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rated <strong>P</strong> for <strong>Pirates</strong>!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565520/extras/b227864d68f51721e1e77c229681f710.avif?t=1784649706\" width=750 height=183 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Maggie has lost her titular, precious <strong>Booty</strong><i>(tm)</i> to a bloody marine <strong>sharkgirl</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With her navigation skills, Maggie will cruise the seas and islands, full of weirdos in search of clues!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But there are <strong>many</strong>, including <strong>marines</strong>, that want Maggie's bountiful reward, for the many <strong>&quot;oopsie-daisies&quot;</strong> that Maggie <strong>&quot;allegedly&quot; committed </strong>with evidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">So, it's not gonna be easy, but Maggie has a <strong>Ph.D in Rocket Jumping</strong> (she made it herself)!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sometimes she talks to her <strong>Rocket Launcher</strong>, it's a bit weird.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565520/extras/19692813c36ae728cd6ed3ed52eb9ee4.avif?t=1784649706\" width=300 height=306 /></span> <i><strong>...AND NOW... THE MAGGIE...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Booty is a swashbuckling, arcade-y 2D platformer game with Rocket Jumping at its core! Aim, charge, jump, shoot and fly across many islands! Loot treasures, blast enemies and climb to the top! Destroy blocks, speedrun through stages, increase your bounty and unlock gameplay-altering curses!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565520/8ab6847d9f674bcc45fd4f1c48a054750de7bec1/header.jpg?t=1784649706", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565520/a48336c6aae0ff26ab3a8304903c08326033b9e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784649706", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565520/a48336c6aae0ff26ab3a8304903c08326033b9e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784649706", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["RocketPirates"], "publishers": ["RocketPirates"], "demos": [{"appid": 4756620, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 39, "description": "Shared/Split Screen Co-op"}, {"id": 24, "description": "Shared/Split Screen"}, {"id": 28, "descrip